  "term": "attribution",
  "definition": "Attribution is the act of assigning a source or authorship to something, and this assignment can shape how people judge and respond to it. In the research described here, labeling music as AI-generated versus human-made influenced listeners’ evaluations such as liking, quality, authenticity, and engagement.",
